            {/* As the host sees it after the refusal: the state refreshed to the note, which says what the refusal says,
                so the sentence shows once, in grey (HostActions). */}
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={revealed("host", "Ola", roundPlayers, fiveResults, 1, QUESTION, false)}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{
                idPrefix: "evening-questions-ran-out",
                host: { error: roomErrorMessage("questions_ran_out") },
              }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="evening-questions-ran-out-unknown" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">
              63. Host: „Następne pytanie” odrzucone, Worker znów nie wie, czy zostały pytania
            </h2>
            {/* The refreshed state still has questionsLeft null (the categories could not be read again), so no note:
                the refusal says it alone, in the same grey. */}
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={revealed("host", "Ola", roundPlayers, fiveResults, 1)}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{
                idPrefix: "evening-questions-ran-out-unknown",
                host: { error: roomErrorMessage("questions_ran_out") },
              }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="evening-skipped-host" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">57. Host: pominięte ostatnie pytanie</h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={skipped("host", "Ola", roundPlayers)}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "evening-skipped-host" }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="evening-skipped-guest" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">58. Gość: pominięte ostatnie pytanie</h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={skipped("guest", "Bartek", roundPlayers)}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "evening-skipped-guest" }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="evening-end-host" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">59. Koniec wieczoru po grze: host</h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={closed("host", "Ola", roundPlayers)}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "evening-end-host" }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="evening-end-guest" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">60. Koniec wieczoru po grze: gość</h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={closed("guest", "Bartek", roundPlayers)}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "evening-end-guest" }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="evening-crash" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">61. Ekran się wysypał (F4)</h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={voting("guest", "Bartek", roundPlayers, ["Ola"])}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "evening-crash", crash: true }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h2 class="border-b pb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Gra: spóźnieni (/r/…)</h2>
        <div class="grid items-start justify-items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1">
          <section id="latecomer-host-vote" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">
              69. Host: głosowanie, 2 prośby o wejście (nick 20 znaków) · hover · focus-visible
            </h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={withRequests(voting("host", "Ola", roundPlayers, ["Bartek", "Zosia"]), [
                "Marta",
                "Najdłuższy nick 20zn",
              ])}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "latecomer-host-vote" }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="latecomer-host-reveal" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">70. Host: odsłona, 1 prośba o wejście</h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={withRequests(revealed("host", "Ola", roundPlayers, fiveResults, 1), ["Marta"])}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "latecomer-host-reveal" }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="latecomer-guest-vote" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">
              71. Wpuszczony w trakcie głosowania: notka i dopisek „od następnego pytania”
            </h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={voting("guest", "Kuba", roundPlayers, ["Ola", "Zosia"], QUESTION, { eligible: beforeKuba })}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "latecomer-guest-vote" }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <h2 class="border-b pb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Połączenie na żywo</h2>
        <div class="grid items-start justify-items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1">
          <section id="live-broken-lobby" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">46. Lobby gościa: połączenie przerwane</h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={lobby("guest", "Ola", guestView)}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "live-broken-lobby", liveBroken: true }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>

          <section id="live-broken-vote" class:list={["flex w-full flex-col gap-3", ROOM_FRAME]}>
            <h2 class="text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">
              47. Głosowanie: połączenie przerwane i błąd odświeżania
            </h2>
            <RoomScreen
              roomId={ROOM_ID}
              initial={voting("guest", "Bartek", roundPlayers, ["Ola", "Bartek", "Zosia"])}
              realtime={null}
              preview={{ idPrefix: "live-broken-vote", liveBroken: true, refreshFailed: true }}
              client:load
            />
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </Layout>
)}
